cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  ER7 Rust: a Cargo workspace of Rust crates for HL7 v2 messages in the
  ER7 pipe-hat encoding.
message: >-
  If you use this work and you want to cite it,
  then you can use the metadata from this file.
